          "alt": "RAF Church Fenton Gate No.7 to the airfield off the east side of Busk Lane near Littleoaks. The Ministry of Defence stopped using the airfield in 2003 and it is now home to the Yorkshire Universities Air Squadron. Nearly all of RAF Church Fenton is actually in Ulleskelf parish, with only the southwest corner of the airfield in Church Fenton.",
